docs/blog-work/the-registry-wave-agentic-artifact-supply-chain/reading-experience-v2/DIRECTION.md-32-V6. **Section markers** (spec §5): ordinal + reserved-width left rule, exactly one active (violet accent), `aria-current="location"` in the outline, rAF-throttled or observer-based, no history pushes, no scroll-jacking. Compositions: `measure` (default), `pane` (primary-pane width for dense figures/tables), `split` (prose + compact card, stacks on narrow), `inset`. Dense technical PNGs use `pane` and open in `FigureViewer`.
