" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Stale operating guidance<\/strong><small>Aug. 7, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A targeted scan distinguishes stale assertions in live guidance from preserved historical records.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>Known assertion patterns can be checked while retaining dated history.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not prove that all remaining prose is current or true.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; not a fresh check.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-provisioning\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Missing capability: discover before replacing<\/strong><small>Aug. 4, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A missing local capability directs the operator toward registry discovery and a suggested deployment action.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A missing local copy need not mean the capability does not exist.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>A suggested action is not evidence that deployment or execution occurred.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; original capture required for stronger claims.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-run-record\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>A run-level evidence record<\/strong><small>Proposed schema \u00b7 no execution claim<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill amber\">Proposed model<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>Link loaded capability identity with context, activity, verification and an accepting authority.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>Defines the relationships a future integration should preserve.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Not an implementation receipt, attestation or measured outcome.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Not applicable \u2014 proposal. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Editorial architecture proposal in the supplied thread manifest.<\/p><\/div><\/details><p class=\"small muted\">Dates above are receipt labels carried from the manuscript, not newly verified event dates.<\/p><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><section class=\"panel\" data-component=\"EvidenceGuide\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVIDENCE GUIDE<\/span><h3>Read the scope.<\/h3><p><strong>Observed account<\/strong><br>Bounded operating account; not causal measurement.<\/p><p><strong>Externally reported<\/strong><br>Attributed to an outside source, not endorsed by the badge.<\/p><p><strong>Proposed / illustrative<\/strong><br>Design or explanation, not runtime proof.<\/p><p><strong>Measured<\/strong><br>Requires a defined method. No outcome-gain claim is supplied here.<\/p><\/section><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Evidence index\" data-component=\"ReceiptIndex\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IN THIS EVIDENCE SET<\/span><div class=\"thread-list\"><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Deployed-copy drift<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-instruction-parity.html\" data-key=\"instruction-parity\">Sibling instruction parity<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-stale-guidance.html\" data-key=\"stale-guidance\">Stale operating guidance<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-provisioning.html\" data-key=\"provisioning\">Missing capability: discover before replacing<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-run-record.html\" data-key=\"run-record\">A run-level evidence record<\/a><\/div><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "contents:all": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">READING NAVIGATION<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Contents<\/h1><nav class=\"content-list\" aria-label=\"Article sections\"><a href=\"index.html#opening\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"opening\"><span>00<\/span>The incident<\/a><a href=\"index.html#registry-wave\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"registry-wave\"><span>01<\/span>What the registry wave solved<\/a><a href=\"index.html#artifacts\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"artifacts\"><span>02<\/span>What counts as an artifact<\/a><a href=\"index.html#follow-reviewer\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"follow-reviewer\"><span>03<\/span>Follow the reviewer<\/a><a href=\"index.html#variation\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"variation\"><span>04<\/span>Some differences must survive<\/a><a href=\"index.html#control-fabric\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"control-fabric\"><span>05<\/span>The handoffs are the architecture<\/a><a href=\"index.html#delivered-outcome\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"delivered-outcome\"><span>06<\/span>From use to outcome<\/a><a href=\"index.html#receipts\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"receipts\"><span>07<\/span>Receipts behind the argument<\/a><a href=\"index.html#closing\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"closing\"><span>08<\/span>The wider estate<\/a><a href=\"index.html#reading-path\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"reading-path\"><span>09<\/span>Where this sits<\/a><a href=\"index.html#sources\" class=\"show-in-essay\" data-anchor=\"sources\"><span>10<\/span>Sources<\/a><\/nav><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" aria-current=step><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>"}, "rootTitle": "Figure \u00b7 Registry Wave"};
