/Users/miethe/dev/WIP/agents/theses/registry-wave/reg-wave-review-v4/registry_wave_experience_v2/tools/build_prototype.py:98:rail='''<aside class="right-rail"><div class="intro-rail" data-component="EntryRail"><section class="panel author"><span class="eyebrow">WRITTEN BY</span><div class="who"><div class="avatar">NM</div><div><h3>Nick Miethe</h3><small>Architect · Builder · Writer</small></div></div><p>Writing about the systems around agentic work: reusable capability, governed execution, and evidence.</p><div class="links"><a href="https://nickmiethe.com/about/">About Nick →</a><a href="https://nickmiethe.com/">More writing →</a></div></section><section class="panel executive" data-component="ExecutiveSignal"><span class="eyebrow">EXECUTIVE SIGNAL</span><h3>Some copies must change.<br>Some differences must survive.</h3><p>A correct registry does not establish the intended or actual state of every consumer.</p></section></div><div class="companion" id="companion" data-component="ReadingCompanion"><section class="panel"><div class="headrow"><h4>ON THIS PAGE</h4><span class="pill violet" id="chapter-count">00</span></div><nav class="outline-links" id="outline-links" aria-label="Nearby article sections"></nav><a href="contents.html" class="outline-more open-focus" data-kind="contents" data-key="all">All sections →</a></section><section class="panel dock" data-component="ThreadDock"><div class="headrow"><span class="eyebrow" style="margin:0">THE RUNNING EXAMPLE</span><button id="dock-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="dock-content">−</button></div><div class="dock-status" id="dock-status">Scene 01 / 06 · following reading</div><h3 id="dock-label">The stale reviewer</h3><div id="dock-content"><p id="dock-copy">The source is fixed. Other project copies are not.</p><div class="actions"><a id="dock-open" href="thread-incident.html" class="button open-focus" data-kind="thread" data-key="incident">Explore thread ↗</a><button id="hold-beat">Hold preview</button></div></div></section><aside class="panel note" id="context-note" data-component="ContextualNote" hidden></aside></div></aside>'''
