"<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 01 / 06 \u2014 Incident<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">The fix existed. The deployed copies did not change.<\/h1><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">The registry reflects the correction. The separate copies used in other projects did not automatically change. The illustration establishes a deployment gap, not an observed adverse outcome.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-incident\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 01 \u00b7 Incident<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"incident\" id=\"enlarge-incident\" href=\"figure-incident.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">The fix existed. The deployed copies did not change.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source corrected<\/strong><small>Correction exists<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry corrected<\/strong><small>Correction reflected<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Copies still stale<\/strong><small>Separate deployed files<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Use differs by project<\/strong><small>Depends on copy loaded<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Run identity unknown<\/strong><small>Not retrospectively inferred<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">The source and registry show the correction. Other deployed copies remain stale. This is not a registry failure.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T01 / Incident<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_incident_resolution_flow.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>A corrected reviewer exists at its source and in the registry. Separate project copies do not automatically receive that correction. No loaded-byte attestation is implied by this illustration.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-incident\" href=\"index.html#thread-incident\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><span><\/span><span class=\"muted\">1 / 6<\/span><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" href=\"thread-deployment.html\">Deployment \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" aria-current=step><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "thread:deployment": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 02 / 06 \u2014 Deployment<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Same name. Different bytes.<\/h1><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">Compare what the project intended to consume with its deployed copy. Do not substitute the registry\u2019s current contents for evidence of what a past session actually loaded.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-deployment\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 02 \u00b7 Deployment<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"deployment\" id=\"enlarge-deployment\" href=\"figure-deployment.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Same name. Different bytes.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source<\/strong><small>Authored revision<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry<\/strong><small>Recorded identity<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Project binding / copy<\/strong><small>Declared versus deployed<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Runtime loading<\/strong><small>Separate observation<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Outcome evidence<\/strong><small>Separate acceptance<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Anchor figure: source identity, registry identity, project deployment, runtime loading, and outcome are separate records.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T02 / Deployment<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_from_source_to_outcome.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>The repeated five-node spine reveals where the handoff was lost. A registry record and a project copy are distinct objects; the deployment record must name the relationship.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-deployment\" href=\"index.html#thread-deployment\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" href=\"thread-incident.html\">\u2190 Incident<\/a><span class=\"muted\">2 / 6<\/span><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" href=\"thread-use.html\">Use \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" ><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" aria-current=step><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "thread:use": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 03 / 06 \u2014 Use<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Present in a file does not mean followed in a run.<\/h1><span class=\"pill amber\">Conceptual branch<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">Now consider a separate question: suppose the corrected instruction is present. Its presence does not establish that a reviewer followed it. This is not the next observed event in the original incident.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-use\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 03 \u00b7 Use<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"use\" id=\"enlarge-use\" href=\"figure-use.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Present in a file does not mean followed in a run.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Corrected source<\/strong><small>Conceptual starting point<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Known artifact<\/strong><small>Known instructions<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Corrected copy assumed<\/strong><small>Assumption for this branch<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Behavior not established<\/strong><small>Presence \u2260 compliance<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Verification required<\/strong><small>Not a success claim<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Separate question: even after a corrected artifact is loaded, the instruction being present does not prove that it was followed.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T03 / Use<\/strong> \u00b7 Conceptual branch. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_presence_vs_behavior.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>This is an analytic branch, not evidence that the original stale run loaded a corrected reviewer. The presence of an instruction and evidence of its execution must not be conflated.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-use\" href=\"index.html#thread-use\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" href=\"thread-deployment.html\">\u2190 Deployment<\/a><span class=\"muted\">3 / 6<\/span><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" href=\"thread-drift.html\">Drift \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" ><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" aria-current=step><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "thread:drift": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 04 / 06 \u2014 Drift<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">For five days, \u201cfixed\u201d described one location.<\/h1><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">Back in the original incident, the source and deployed state disagreed for five days. That interval is reported in the account; it is not a continuous monitoring trace or a new calendar reconstruction.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-drift\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 04 \u00b7 Drift<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"drift\" id=\"enlarge-drift\" href=\"figure-drift.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">For five days, \u201cfixed\u201d described one location.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source fixed<\/strong><small>Unchanged corrected source<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry reflects fix<\/strong><small>Unchanged registry state<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Day 1 \u2192 Day 5<\/strong><small>Reported interval<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Copies unchanged<\/strong><small>Not a new measurement<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Mismatch unreported<\/strong><small>Before the added check<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Return to the incident: the source stayed corrected while the deployed state stayed behind. The exact calendar range is not invented here.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T04 / Drift<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_drift_across_five_days.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>The figure shows a five-day interval of disagreement, not five new measurements or a claim of continuous monitoring. Preserve the documented interval without inventing calendar dates.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-drift\" href=\"index.html#thread-drift\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" href=\"thread-use.html\">\u2190 Use<\/a><span class=\"muted\">4 / 6<\/span><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" href=\"thread-detection.html\">Detection \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" ><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" aria-current=step><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "thread:detection": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 05 / 06 \u2014 Detection<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">A comparison makes the silent difference visible.<\/h1><span class=\"pill cyan\">Mechanism summary<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">The supplied account describes a byte-comparison check. It can identify a mismatch within its declared scope. It does not establish that every artifact is registered or that all behavioral requirements are enforced.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-detection\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 05 \u00b7 Detection<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"detection\" id=\"enlarge-detection\" href=\"figure-detection.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">A comparison makes the silent difference visible.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Declared reference<\/strong><small>Explicit comparison basis<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Tracked deployment<\/strong><small>In declared scope<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Compare bytes<\/strong><small>Mechanical comparison<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Mismatch surfaced<\/strong><small>Finding, not behavior proof<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Review / repair decision<\/strong><small>Human/authorized decision<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">The byte-comparison mechanism surfaces drift. A historical receipt and a later demonstration are different evidence objects.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T05 / Detection<\/strong> \u00b7 Mechanism summary. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_detecting_silent_drift.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>The supplied prose locates a drift-check receipt on August 6. This spec preserves that reference without resolving the earlier event-versus-receipt date ambiguity. A nonzero exit does not by itself identify which finding fired.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-detection\" href=\"index.html#thread-detection\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" href=\"thread-drift.html\">\u2190 Drift<\/a><span class=\"muted\">5 / 6<\/span><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" href=\"thread-outcome.html\">Outcome \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" ><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" aria-current=step><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" ><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "thread:outcome": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD FOCUS \u00b7 06 / 06 \u2014 Outcome<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Name what actually loaded\u2014or say it is unknown.<\/h1><span class=\"pill amber\">Proposed model<\/span><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">A proposed run record links loaded identity, context, actions, verification and acceptance. Values not captured remain unknown. This example is not a completed integration or a measured improvement.<\/p><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-outcome\">\n    <div class=\"figure-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD 06 \u00b7 Outcome<\/span><a class=\"open-focus\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-key=\"outcome\" id=\"enlarge-outcome\" href=\"figure-outcome.html\">Enlarge figure \u2197<\/a><\/div>\n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Name what actually loaded\u2014or say it is unknown.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Loaded identity<\/strong><small>Unknown unless captured<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Context / policy<\/strong><small>Bound to the run<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Observed actions<\/strong><small>Evidence, not intention<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Verification evidence<\/strong><small>Criteria and results<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Accepting authority<\/strong><small>Who accepted what<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">A proposed run-level record links loaded artifact identity to context, actions, verification, and acceptance. Unknown values remain unknown.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T06 / Outcome<\/strong> \u00b7 Proposed model. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_run_level_provenance_infographic.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"focus-limit\"><strong>Evidence boundary<\/strong>The missing record should identify the capability actually loaded and connect the resulting work to its verification and accepting authority. The drawing does not establish implementation or an improved outcome.<\/div><div class=\"receipt-actions\"><a href=\"evidence-run-record.html\" class=\"open-focus text-link\" data-kind=\"evidence\" data-key=\"run-record\">Inspect related evidence \u2197<\/a><a class=\"show-in-essay text-link\" data-anchor=\"thread-outcome\" href=\"index.html#thread-outcome\">Read this scene in the essay \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"focus-footer\"><a class=\"button choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" href=\"thread-detection.html\">\u2190 Detection<\/a><span class=\"muted\">6 / 6<\/span><span><\/span><\/div><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><aside class=\"panel\" data-component=\"RunningExampleCard\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RUNNING EXAMPLE<\/span><h3>The stale reviewer<\/h3><p>One reviewer instruction artifact, followed across six explanatory scenes.<\/p><span class=\"pill\">task-completion-validator<\/span><dl class=\"fact-list\"><dt>Role<\/dt><dd>Reviewer instructions<\/dd><dt>Source<\/dt><dd>Supplied essay account<\/dd><dt>Versions<\/dt><dd>No new version asserted here<\/dd><dt>Scope<\/dt><dd>Personal-lab example<\/dd><\/dl><\/aside><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Thread scenes\" data-component=\"ThreadOverview\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THREAD OVERVIEW \u00b7 SIX SCENES<\/span><h3>Follow the example<\/h3><div class=\"thread-list\"><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"incident\" ><span>01<\/span><div>Incident<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"deployment\" ><span>02<\/span><div>Deployment<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-use.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"use\" ><span>03<\/span><div>Use<small>Conceptual branch<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"drift\" ><span>04<\/span><div>Drift<small>Observed account<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"detection\" ><span>05<\/span><div>Detection<small>Mechanism summary<\/small><\/div><\/a><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" class=\"choose-beat\" data-key=\"outcome\" aria-current=step><span>06<\/span><div>Outcome<small>Proposed model<\/small><\/div><\/a><\/div><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">Editorial sequence, not six observed events in one run.<\/p><\/nav><\/aside><\/div>", "figure:incident": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T01<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-incident\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">The fix existed. The deployed copies did not change.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source corrected<\/strong><small>Correction exists<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry corrected<\/strong><small>Correction reflected<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Copies still stale<\/strong><small>Separate deployed files<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Use differs by project<\/strong><small>Depends on copy loaded<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Run identity unknown<\/strong><small>Not retrospectively inferred<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">The source and registry show the correction. Other deployed copies remain stale. This is not a registry failure.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T01 / Incident<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_incident_resolution_flow.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Incident: The fix existed. The deployed copies did not change.<\/h1><p>The source and registry show the correction. Other deployed copies remain stale. This is not a registry failure.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">A corrected reviewer exists at its source and in the registry. Separate project copies do not automatically receive that correction. No loaded-byte attestation is implied by this illustration.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-incident.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"incident\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "figure:deployment": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T02<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-deployment\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Same name. Different bytes.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source<\/strong><small>Authored revision<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry<\/strong><small>Recorded identity<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Project binding / copy<\/strong><small>Declared versus deployed<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Runtime loading<\/strong><small>Separate observation<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Outcome evidence<\/strong><small>Separate acceptance<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Anchor figure: source identity, registry identity, project deployment, runtime loading, and outcome are separate records.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T02 / Deployment<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_from_source_to_outcome.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Deployment: Same name. Different bytes.<\/h1><p>Anchor figure: source identity, registry identity, project deployment, runtime loading, and outcome are separate records.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">The repeated five-node spine reveals where the handoff was lost. A registry record and a project copy are distinct objects; the deployment record must name the relationship.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-deployment.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"deployment\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "figure:use": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T03<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-use\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Present in a file does not mean followed in a run.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Corrected source<\/strong><small>Conceptual starting point<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Known artifact<\/strong><small>Known instructions<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Corrected copy assumed<\/strong><small>Assumption for this branch<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Behavior not established<\/strong><small>Presence \u2260 compliance<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Verification required<\/strong><small>Not a success claim<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Separate question: even after a corrected artifact is loaded, the instruction being present does not prove that it was followed.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T03 / Use<\/strong> \u00b7 Conceptual branch. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_presence_vs_behavior.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Use: Present in a file does not mean followed in a run.<\/h1><p>Separate question: even after a corrected artifact is loaded, the instruction being present does not prove that it was followed.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">This is an analytic branch, not evidence that the original stale run loaded a corrected reviewer. The presence of an instruction and evidence of its execution must not be conflated.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-use.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"use\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "figure:drift": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T04<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-drift\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">For five days, \u201cfixed\u201d described one location.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Source fixed<\/strong><small>Unchanged corrected source<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Registry reflects fix<\/strong><small>Unchanged registry state<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Day 1 \u2192 Day 5<\/strong><small>Reported interval<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Copies unchanged<\/strong><small>Not a new measurement<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Mismatch unreported<\/strong><small>Before the added check<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">Return to the incident: the source stayed corrected while the deployed state stayed behind. The exact calendar range is not invented here.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T04 / Drift<\/strong> \u00b7 Observed account. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_drift_across_five_days.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Drift: For five days, \u201cfixed\u201d described one location.<\/h1><p>Return to the incident: the source stayed corrected while the deployed state stayed behind. The exact calendar range is not invented here.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">The figure shows a five-day interval of disagreement, not five new measurements or a claim of continuous monitoring. Preserve the documented interval without inventing calendar dates.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-drift.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"drift\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "figure:detection": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T05<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-detection\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">A comparison makes the silent difference visible.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Declared reference<\/strong><small>Explicit comparison basis<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Tracked deployment<\/strong><small>In declared scope<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Compare bytes<\/strong><small>Mechanical comparison<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Mismatch surfaced<\/strong><small>Finding, not behavior proof<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Review / repair decision<\/strong><small>Human/authorized decision<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">The byte-comparison mechanism surfaces drift. A historical receipt and a later demonstration are different evidence objects.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T05 / Detection<\/strong> \u00b7 Mechanism summary. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_detecting_silent_drift.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Detection: A comparison makes the silent difference visible.<\/h1><p>The byte-comparison mechanism surfaces drift. A historical receipt and a later demonstration are different evidence objects.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">The supplied prose locates a drift-check receipt on August 6. This spec preserves that reference without resolving the earlier event-versus-receipt date ambiguity. A nonzero exit does not by itself identify which finding fired.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-detection.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"detection\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "figure:outcome": "<div class=\"figure-mode\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIGURE VIEWER \u00b7 T06<\/span><figure class=\"figure\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"figure-outcome\">\n    \n    <div class=\"diagram\"><div class=\"diagram-title\">Name what actually loaded\u2014or say it is unknown.<\/div><div class=\"chain\"><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a4<\/span><strong>Loaded identity<\/strong><small>Unknown unless captured<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25c7<\/span><strong>Context / policy<\/strong><small>Bound to the run<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node emphasis\"><span class=\"glyph\">\u25a7<\/span><strong>Observed actions<\/strong><small>Evidence, not intention<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node \"><span class=\"glyph\">\u2b21<\/span><strong>Verification evidence<\/strong><small>Criteria and results<\/small><\/div><div class=\"node unknown\"><span class=\"glyph\">?<\/span><strong>Accepting authority<\/strong><small>Who accepted what<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"diagram-limit\">A proposed run-level record links loaded artifact identity to context, actions, verification, and acceptance. Unknown values remain unknown.<\/div><\/div>\n    <figcaption><strong>T06 / Outcome<\/strong> \u00b7 Proposed model. Explanatory layout schematic; not an execution capture.<span class=\"asset-note\">REPLACE WITH APPROVED ARTWORK: registry_wave_run_level_provenance_infographic.png<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"viewer-foot\"><div><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Outcome: Name what actually loaded\u2014or say it is unknown.<\/h1><p>A proposed run-level record links loaded artifact identity to context, actions, verification, and acceptance. Unknown values remain unknown.<\/p><details><summary>Long description<\/summary><p style=\"margin-top:15px\">The missing record should identify the capability actually loaded and connect the resulting work to its verification and accepting authority. The drawing does not establish implementation or an improved outcome.<\/p><\/details><\/div><div><span class=\"pill amber\">Layout schematic<\/span><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Actual canonical PNG unavailable in this environment. No SVG download is advertised for raster art.<\/p><a href=\"thread-outcome.html\" data-kind=\"thread\" data-key=\"outcome\" class=\"open-focus text-link\">Open thread context \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div>", "evidence:drift-check": "<div class=\"focus-grid\"><main class=\"focus-main\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVIDENCE FOCUS \u00b7 REGISTRY WAVE<\/span><h1 id=\"focus-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Receipts behind the argument<\/h1><p class=\"lead\">What the records support\u2014and what they do not.<\/p><p>These are bounded method summaries from the supplied manuscript. Original captures must be linked before publication. This view reports no measured outcome improvement.<\/p><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">RECEIPTS / EXPAND TO INSPECT<\/div><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-drift-check\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" open><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Deployed-copy drift<\/strong><small>Aug. 6, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A stale reviewer prompted a comparison between tracked deployments and their declared sources.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A bounded comparison can expose a declared-versus-deployed mismatch.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not prove runtime behavior, estate-wide coverage or fewer review failures.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript. Original capture must be attached locally.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-instruction-parity\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Sibling instruction parity<\/strong><small>Aug. 5, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A separate check compares required facts across paired harness instruction files.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A defined parity rule can identify omissions in its declared pairs.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not establish semantic correctness of every instruction or every harness.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; not a fresh check.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-stale-guidance\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Stale operating guidance<\/strong><small>Aug. 7, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A targeted scan distinguishes stale assertions in live guidance from preserved historical records.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>Known assertion patterns can be checked while retaining dated history.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not prove that all remaining prose is current or true.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; not a fresh check.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-provisioning\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Missing capability: discover before replacing<\/strong><small>Aug. 4, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A missing local capability directs the operator toward registry discovery and a suggested deployment action.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A missing local copy need not mean the capability does not exist.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>A suggested action is not evidence that deployment or execution occurred.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; original capture required for stronger claims.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-run-record\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>A run-level evidence record<\/strong><small>Proposed schema \u00b7 no execution claim<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill amber\">Proposed model<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>Link loaded capability identity with context, activity, verification and an accepting authority.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>Defines the relationships a future integration should preserve.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Not an implementation receipt, attestation or measured outcome.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Not applicable \u2014 proposal. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Editorial architecture proposal in the supplied thread manifest.<\/p><\/div><\/details><p class=\"small muted\">Dates above are receipt labels carried from the manuscript, not newly verified event dates.<\/p><\/main><aside class=\"focus-side\"><section class=\"panel\" data-component=\"EvidenceGuide\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EVIDENCE GUIDE<\/span><h3>Read the scope.<\/h3><p><strong>Observed account<\/strong><br>Bounded operating account; not causal measurement.<\/p><p><strong>Externally reported<\/strong><br>Attributed to an outside source, not endorsed by the badge.<\/p><p><strong>Proposed / illustrative<\/strong><br>Design or explanation, not runtime proof.<\/p><p><strong>Measured<\/strong><br>Requires a defined method. No outcome-gain claim is supplied here.<\/p><\/section><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Evidence index\" data-component=\"ReceiptIndex\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IN THIS EVIDENCE SET<\/span><div class=\"thread-list\"><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-drift-check.html\" data-key=\"drift-check\">Deployed-copy drift<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-instruction-parity.html\" data-key=\"instruction-parity\">Sibling instruction parity<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-stale-guidance.html\" data-key=\"stale-guidance\">Stale operating guidance<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-provisioning.html\" data-key=\"provisioning\">Missing capability: discover before replacing<\/a><a class=\"choose-receipt\" href=\"evidence-run-record.html\" data-key=\"run-record\">A run-level e