)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Deployed-copy drift<\/strong><small>Aug. 6, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A stale reviewer prompted a comparison between tracked deployments and their declared sources.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A bounded comparison can expose a declared-versus-deployed mismatch.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not prove runtime behavior, estate-wide coverage or fewer review failures.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript. Original capture must be attached locally.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-instruction-parity\" data-component=\"ReceiptDisclosure\" ><summary><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:var(--cyan)\">\u25a4<\/span><span><strong>Sibling instruction parity<\/strong><small>Aug. 5, 2026 \u00b7 manuscript receipt date<\/small><\/span><\/summary><div class=\"receipt-body\"><span class=\"pill cyan\">Observed account<\/span><div style=\"height:15px\"><\/div><p>A separate check compares required facts across paired harness instruction files.<\/p><div class=\"columns\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Supports<\/span><p>A defined parity rule can identify omissions in its declared pairs.<\/p><\/div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Does not establish<\/span><p>Does not establish semantic correctness of every instruction or every harness.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"no-evidence\">Primary capture not included. No generated terminal output or fabricated commit ID.<\/div><p class=\"source-note\">Method summary from the supplied manuscript; not a fresh check.<\/p><\/div><\/details><details class=\"receipt\" id=\"receipt-stale-guidance\