Implemented the P0-D and P1 reading-experience work without touching `src/content/**` or opening any image files.

Files changed include [PostLayout.astro](/Users/miethe/dev/homelab/development/signal_to_system/.wt/rw-v2-essay/src/layouts/PostLayout.astro), [focus-host.ts](/Users/miethe/dev/homelab/development/signal_to_system/.wt/rw-v2-essay/src/lib/focus-host.ts), [MobileContents.astro](/Users/miethe/dev/homelab/development/signal_to_system/.wt/rw-v2-essay/src/components/content/MobileContents.astro), [ContextualNote.astro](/Users/miethe/dev/homelab/development/signal_to_system/.wt/rw-v2-essay/src/components/content/ContextualNote.astro), companion/dock/marker components, and figure styling.

1. Done: responsive native-dialog Contents sheet, outline/thread/evidence links, Escape/backdrop/trigger restoration, and no-JS `#post-contents` fallback.

2. Done: FocusHost captures a stable heading or scene anchor plus relative offset, restores anchor-relatively, and retains distinct Back versus Read-this-scene behavior.

3. Partial: native FocusHost dialog uses `showModal`, existing Escape/trigger behavior, and the Figure Viewer now constrains image height so metadata is reachable by scrolling the dialog. Browser keyboard verification could not run.

4. Done: inspected `ArtifactTaxonomy` and `ArtifactControlPlane`; they already use buttons with `aria-pressed` and no tab/listitem role misuse. Removed nested rail scroll ownership.

5. Done: authored ContextualNotes render one at a time for active mapped sections, with native disclosure and per-visit dismissal.

6. Done: ThreadDock has manual collapse and hold state, with held-versus-reading copy.

7. Done: SectionMarker receives the existing observer’s active section event and applies exactly one reserved-width violet rule.

8. Done: cheap FIX-LIST polish: figure header/enlarge affordance, Figure Viewer title hierarchy, left-aligned ThreadScene heading. Skipped broader focus/evidence visual redesign items.

Validation: `git diff --check` passed. `npm run build` and `npm run check` could not start:

```text
Now using node v22.20.0
ERROR: SecItemCopyMatching failed -67674
```

I could not verify the 93-page build, touched-file check results, runtime keyboard behavior, or the other-essay `dist/` spot-check because Node exits before Astro runs.
